# Enforce LF line endings for all text files. Factorio's Lua runtime chokes on
# CRLF in some cases, and mixed endings create noisy `git status` output on
# Windows checkouts. Never commit line-ending-only changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary (keeps git from trying to diff/merge them as text)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.webm binary
